#. Description of the plugin
msgid ""
"Adds icon elements to place on pages, uses icons from Lucide Icons, Material "
"Icons and other various icon libraries. Integrates with some WordPress "
"themes like Flatsome."
msgstr ""
"Adds icon elements to place on pages, uses icons from Lucide Icons, Material "
"Icons and other various icon libraries. Integrates with some WordPress "
"themes like Flatsome."

